WEBVTT

00:00:29.560 --> 00:00:32.616
and here I come, learning
one language after another.

00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:34.856
They wanted to know
the secret of polyglots,

00:00:34.880 --> 00:00:36.600
people who speak a lot of languages.

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:38.816
And that made me wonder, too,

00:00:38.840 --> 00:00:41.136
how do actually other polyglots do it?

00:00:41.160 --> 00:00:42.656
What do we have in common?

00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:44.616
And what is it that enables us

00:00:44.640 --> 00:00:47.080
to learn languages
so much faster than other people?

00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:50.720
I decided to meet other people
like me and find that out.

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:53.816
The best place to meet a lot of polyglots

00:00:53.840 --> 00:00:56.136
is an event where hundreds
of language lovers

00:00:56.160 --> 00:00:59.016
meet in one place
to practice their languages.

00:00:59.040 --> 00:01:02.336
There are several such polyglot events
organized all around the world,